01:04:11.593 --> 01:04:13.053
This is a great opportunity,

01:04:15.270 --> 01:04:16.613
is still a ministry.

01:04:17.490 --> 01:04:18.750
But we wrote two songs,

01:04:18.750 --> 01:04:21.300
