01:04:30.561 --> 01:04:32.100
He was super nice.

01:04:32.100 --> 01:04:35.780
He had some mentorship influence on us.

01:04:35.780 --> 01:04:39.140
We came back, we started to think,

01:04:39.140 --> 01:04:41.270
what if we worked with Phil on this thing?

