01:04:55.880 --> 01:04:58.550
Well, and give some context of that.

01:04:58.550 --> 01:04:59.383
Like what led--

01:04:59.383 --> 01:05:00.680
We were just trying to make.

01:05:00.680 --> 01:05:03.903
Well, again, what started as,

01:05:05.350 --> 01:05:09.420
again, I think that we
always were most passionate

01:05:09.420 --> 01:05:10.500
just to be completely honest,

01:05:10.500 --> 01:05:12.840
we were most passionate
about the performance

01:05:12.840 --> 01:05:16.350
